@startuml
actor User
participant Page
participant "Content Script (content.js)" as CS
participant "Service Worker (background.js)" as SW
database "chrome.storage" as Storage
participant "Mixpanel API" as Remote

User -> Page: Visits website
Page -> CS: Execute content script
CS -> SW: sendMessage(messageTypes)
SW -> Storage: Read/Write (machineKey, authKey, etc.)
Storage --> SW: Data
SW -> Remote: POST /track (Mixpanel events)
Remote --> SW: OK
SW --> CS: Response
CS -> Page: UI updates
@enduml
